      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Au</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Ag</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math>",
